  "Password must be {0}-{1} characters.": "密码长度必须为 {0}–{1} 个字符。",
  "Use standard English letters/numbers for the account name and printable ASCII characters for the password.": "账户名请使用英文字母或数字，密码请使用可打印的 ASCII 字符。",
  "Email is required.": "必须填写电子邮箱。",
