  "With automatic game login enabled, Remember me also saves your game credentials using system encryption.": "启用游戏自动登录后，“记住我”也会使用系统加密保存游戏凭据。",
  "Added a welcome screen requiring account sign-in before entering the launcher.": "新增欢迎页面，进入启动器前需要登录账号。",
  "Added Remember me with encrypted account sessions and optional saved game auto-login credentials.": "新增“记住我”，支持加密账号会话和可选的游戏自动登录凭据。",
  "Client downloads and repairs now require the exact launcher version configured on the backend; launcher updates remain available.": "客户端下载和修复现在要求与服务器配置的启动器版本完全一致；启动器更新仍然可用。",
